@startuml
title S7  Save, list and remove favorites  US-12 / US-13
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API
participant FavoriteService as Favorite
database "Owned recipe /\nfavorite repositories" as Store
User -> UI : save, browse or remove favorite
UI -> API : request /favorites
ref over API : S8: verified owner
alt POST /favorites with body recipeId
  API -> Favorite : save(owner, recipeId)
  Favorite -> Store : findOwned(owner, recipeId)
  alt missing or foreign recipe
    Store --> Favorite : no owned row
    Favorite --> API : unavailable
    API --> UI : 404; no write
  else owned recipe
    Store --> Favorite : recipe
    Favorite -> Store : upsert(owner, recipeId)
    Store --> Favorite : committed unique association
    Favorite --> API : recipe
    API --> UI : 200 recipe; repeats return same recipe
  end
else GET /favorites
  API -> Favorite : list(owner)
  Favorite -> Store : listByOwner(owner)
  Favorite --> API : recipes or []
  API --> UI : 200 list
else DELETE /favorites/:recipeId
  API -> Favorite : remove(owner, recipeId)
  Favorite -> Store : deleteOwned(owner, recipeId)
  Favorite --> API : removed or unavailable
  API --> UI : 204 if removed; otherwise 404
end
note over Favorite, Store : No writes to recipes, history or inventory.
@enduml
